														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3190470">
									

<p>This is a tough one.</p>
<p>This is one of the rare SCPs that aims for an emotion other than fear or curiosity. It's heartfelt and touching and I like that.</p>
<p>With that said, it feels a little <em>too</em> nice for my taste. Everything works out fine, it really was just trying to help&#8230;plus, it pushed my suspension of disbelief a bit that the Foundation would be fine with her just playing with a cat after clearly developing an emotional attachment. Again, though, this humanizes the entire research staff in a way that really appeals to me, so that's sort of a point in its favor.</p>
<p>After much consideration and internal debate, I think I like more about this than I don't. +1.</p>

							</div>

								
					
